The sync system protects your work, but it's still important to use version control. Always commit before running sync so you can easily roll back if needed.
{% /aside %}

{% aside type="tip" %}
Use the "custom-" naming convention liberally. Any file or directory with "custom-" in the name is automatically protected from framework updates, giving you instant safety without configuration.
{% /aside %}

